name: One approved workflow proposal, held drafts, explicit actions and durable recovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/workflow_proposal.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: /plan Inspect this owned repository.
require-live-snap: 25 WORKFLOW PROPOSAL PLAN | proposal-draft
expect: one proposal job
expect: openai-codex:gpt-5.5
keys: G End
paste-file: @ART/goal-edit.txt
require-live-snap: 20 Keep uncertainty explicit | goal-editor
keys: Escape Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Proposal draft kept | draft-held
type: /plan
live-snap: resume-command-draft
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 WORKFLOW PROPOSAL PLAN | restored-draft
keys: G
require-live-snap: 20 Keep uncertainty explicit | restored-goal
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 WORKFLOW PROPOSAL PLAN | saved-goal
keys: t C-a
type: 2
keys: Enter r C-a
type: 1
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Plan digest | frozen-proposal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/workflow_proposal.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
ask: Does this proposal clearly show the selected model, fixed work, shared allowance and protected Review capacity before a request?
keys: Enter End
require-live-snap: 25 y approve | approval
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Open approved proposal job | approved-proposal
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 L starts the approved jobs | proposal-jobs
keys: L
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/workflow_proposal.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r a
require-live-snap: 25 Labeled workflow proposal | proposal-result
expect: Inspect workflow proposal
resize: 160x48
live-snap: proposal-result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: proposal-result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: proposal-result-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: proposal-result-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: proposal-result-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: proposal-result-paged-40x12
ask: Is the proposal readable across terminal sizes, with uncertainty and controls visible and no action applied automatically?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home Enter
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN · goal | action-review
expect: Inspect context coverage
keys: n
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/workflow_proposal.py @TMP_TARGET @ART discarded
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 1 completed | restarted-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Labeled workflow proposal | restarted-proposal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/workflow_proposal.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does the original proposal and spending receipt remain available after restart without another request or implied action approval?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 a context result | returned-to-jobs
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
